ZVSE2

** PEGASUS HARNESS - combination artifact (neck)
**
** Parts: Necklace of Swiftness (97) + Ring of the Wayfarer (69) + Cape of Velocity (99).
** When combined, the parts no longer count as equipped, so the game's own speed bonuses and the
** Advanced Classes Mod "Pegasus Harness" set bonuses of the parts are given by this artifact instead:
**   - all creatures in the army: +4 combat speed
**   - 10% chance to completely dodge a melee or ranged attack
**   - the slowest creature in the army: +5 combat speed
** Extra bonuses:
**   - all creatures in the army: expert Air Shield for 50 rounds
**   - all creatures in the army: +1 minimum and +1 maximum damage
** War machines and arrow towers get no bonus.
**
** Artifact 280, combination slot 23. Icon: artifact.def frame 280 (Data/00 forge and fury.pac) and
** Data/Defs/artifact.def/0_280.png (Data/forge and fury.zip).
** Enabled/disabled in WoG Options -> Custom Scripts, option 955 "Custom Artifacts" (shared by all new artifacts).

; ============= SETTINGS ===========================================================================

!#DC(PH_OPTION)             = 955;       [shared option "Custom Artifacts"]
!#DC(PH_ART)                = 280;
!#DC(PH_COMBO_SLOT)         = 23;       [ResOunD uses combination slots 13-22]
!#DC(PH_COST)               = 20000;
!#DC(PH_ART_CLASS)          = 16;       [Relic]
!#DC(PH_ART_POSITION)       = 3;        [Neck (ERM Format P2)]

!#DC(PH_SPEED_ALL)          = 4;
!#DC(PH_SPEED_SLOWEST)      = 5;
!#DC(PH_DODGE_CHANCE)       = 10;       [%]
!#DC(PH_DAMAGE_BONUS)       = 1;
!#DC(PH_AIR_SHIELD_ROUNDS)  = 50;
!#DC(PH_AIR_SHIELD_LEVEL)   = 3;        [Expert]

!#UN:P(PH_OPTION)/?i^ph_enabled^;
!#VRi^ph_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; Named globals are stored in savegames, so re-read the option after a game is started or loaded
!?FU(OnStartOrLoad);
!!UN:P(PH_OPTION)/?i^ph_enabled^;
!!VRi^ph_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; ============= ARTIFACT SETUP =====================================================================
; Done at script start and after loading a game, like ResOunD does for its combination artifacts.

!?FU(PH_SetUpArtifact);
!!UN:A(PH_ART)/1/(PH_COST);
!!UN:A(PH_ART)/2/(PH_ART_POSITION);
!!UN:A(PH_ART)/3/(PH_ART_CLASS);
!!UN:A(PH_ART)/1;                       [never appears on the map: it is only made from its parts]

!!SN:H^art^/(PH_ART)/0/^Pegasus Harness^;
!!SN:H^art^/(PH_ART)/1/^{Pegasus Harness}

Forged from the Necklace of Swiftness, the Ring of the Wayfarer and the Cape of Velocity, this harness lends the speed of the pegasus to every creature in your army.

- All your creatures: +4 combat speed, +1 minimum and maximum damage and expert Air Shield for 50 rounds.
- Your slowest creature: an extra +5 combat speed.
- 10%% chance to completely dodge any melee or ranged attack.^;

!!UN:A(PH_COMBO_SLOT)/(PH_ART)/(ART_NECKLACE_OF_SWIFTNESS)/(ART_RING_OF_THE_WAYFARER)/(ART_CAPE_OF_VELOCITY);

!#FU(PH_SetUpArtifact)&i^ph_enabled^:P;

!?FU(OnAfterLoadGame)&i^ph_enabled^;
!!FU(PH_SetUpArtifact):P;

; ============= HELPERS ============================================================================

; Returns TRUE if the hero of the given battle side wears the Pegasus Harness
!?FU(PH_SideHasHarness);
!#VA(side:x) (result:x);

!!VR(result):S(FALSE);
!!BA:H(side)/?(hero:y);
!!FU&(hero)<=(NO_HERO):E;

!!HE(hero):A2/(PH_ART)/?(count:y)/?(equipped:y);
!!VR(result)&(equipped)>0:S(TRUE);

; ============= BATTLE START BONUSES ===============================================================

!?FU(OnBattleRound)&i^ph_enabled^/i^battle_round^=0;
!!FU(PH_ApplyBattleBonuses):P(BATTLE_LEFT) P(BATTLE_RIGHT);

!?FU(PH_ApplyBattleBonuses);
!#VA(side:x);

!!FU(PH_SideHasHarness):P(side)/?(hasHarness:y);
!!FU&(hasHarness)<>(TRUE):E;

!!VR(first:y):S(BATTLE_ATTACKER_STACK_FIRST);
!!VR(last:y):S(BATTLE_ATTACKER_STACK_LAST);
!!VR(first)&(side)=(BATTLE_RIGHT):S(BATTLE_DEFENDER_STACK_FIRST);
!!VR(last)&(side)=(BATTLE_RIGHT):S(BATTLE_DEFENDER_STACK_LAST);

!!VR(slowest:y):S(NO_STACK);
!!VR(slowestSpeed:y):S(INT_MAX);

!!re i/(first)/(last);
  !!BMi:T?(type:y) N?(num:y);
  !!co&(num)<=0;
  !!co&(type)>=(MON_CATAPULT)/(type)<=(MON_ARROW_TOWERS);  [war machines and towers]

  !!BMi:Sd(PH_SPEED_ALL);
  !!BMi:U1/d(PH_DAMAGE_BONUS) U2/d(PH_DAMAGE_BONUS);
  !!BMi:M(SPELL_AIR_SHIELD)/(PH_AIR_SHIELD_ROUNDS)/(PH_AIR_SHIELD_LEVEL);

  !!BMi:S?(speed:y);
  !!if&(speed)<(slowestSpeed);
    !!VR(slowestSpeed):S(speed);
    !!VR(slowest):Si;
  !!en;
!!en;

!!BM(slowest)&(slowest)<>(NO_STACK):Sd(PH_SPEED_SLOWEST);

; ============= DODGE ==============================================================================
; Same effect as the Advanced Classes Mod "Air Dodge" of the Pegasus Harness set.

!?FU(OnMonsterPhysicalDamage)&i^ph_enabled^;
!!BG:A?(action:y);
!!FU&(action)<>(BATTLE_ACTION_WALK_AND_ATTACK)/(action)<>(BATTLE_ACTION_SHOOT):E;

!!MF:N?(stack:y);
!!BM(stack):I?(side:y);
!!FU(PH_SideHasHarness):P(side)/?(hasHarness:y);
!!FU&(hasHarness)<>(TRUE):E;

!!VR(roll:y):R0/0/99;
!!FU&(roll)>=(PH_DODGE_CHANCE):E;

!!MF:E0 F0;
!!VRz-1:S^AIRSHELD^;
!!SN&i^battle_isVisible^:Pz-1;
!!SN:T^AC_Misc.Air Dodge^/?(msg:z);
!!BU&i^battle_isVisible^:M(msg);
